@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Progress Report Generation and Download

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

actor User
participant "React Web App" as Frontend
participant "Report Controller" as Controller
participant "Report Service" as Service
participant "Analytics Service" as Analytics
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "HTML Report Builder" as Builder
participant "Report File Storage" as Files

User -> Frontend: Select daily, weekly,\nmonthly, or custom period
Frontend -> Controller: POST /api/reports/generate\n(periodType, startDate?, endDate?)
Controller -> Service: Generate(userId, request)
Service -> Analytics: Resolve range and build summary
Analytics -> DB: Query user-owned domain records
DB --> Analytics: Profile, workout, meal,\nbody, goal and milestone data
Analytics -> Analytics: Calculate requested-period indicators
Analytics --> Service: DashboardSummary
Service -> Service: Build deterministic narrative summary
Service -> Builder: Build HTML(reportId, metrics, narrative)
Builder --> Service: HTML document
Service -> Files: Write {reportId}.html
Files --> Service: File saved
Service -> DB: Save report metadata and download URL
DB --> Service: Saved report
Service --> Controller: Report metadata and metrics
Controller --> Frontend: 201 Created
Frontend --> User: Display report history

User -> Frontend: Click Download
Frontend -> Controller: GET /api/reports/{id}/download
Controller -> Service: Verify report ownership
Service -> DB: Retrieve report metadata
DB --> Service: Owned report
Service --> Controller: Local HTML path
Controller -> Files: Read generated HTML file
Files --> Controller: HTML document
Controller --> Frontend: Attachment response
Frontend --> User: Save progress-report-{id}.html
@enduml
